# AumMon — environment variable template
# Copy to .env.local (git-ignored) and fill in values from your Supabase DEV project.
#
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Frontend (browser) — PUBLIC values only. Everything prefixed with VITE_ is
# bundled into client JavaScript and visible to every player.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Server / Edge Functions ONLY — do NOT put these in .env.local for Vite,
# never prefix them with VITE_, never commit real values.
# Set them with `supabase secrets set` (hosted) or supabase/functions/.env
# (local, git-ignored). Exact names depend on the Supabase key model in use.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# SUPABASE_URL=
# SUPABASE_SECRET_KEY=
